# A RED GENERATE. generate is the pivot and nothing precedes it, so there is
# nothing to compensate: the run winds back over an empty prefix and lands
# `:compensated`, the checks never start (flow.md §4.7, §4.8; RULED: CICD-1).
#
#   cx flow simulate docs-src/flow/docs.flow.cx docs-src/flow/sim/docs-red-generate.cx \
#     --env docs-src/flow/docs.env.cx --allow-read=. --mode=write
[results
  [step name="generate" status=:failed
        [result [err code='cx-err:CXER0100'
                     message='make docs-generate is RED (exit 2): a cited fixture no longer reproduces']]]]
